      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Input includes : \n\n1) Sanitized image (blur or\nblackout)\n\n2) DOM element int array like\nthis {\n      id: \"el_1\",\n      tag: \"button\",\n      selector: \"#submit-btn\",\n      box: { x: 10, y: 10,\nwidth: 80, height: 30 },\n      sensitive: false,\n    }\n\n3) redactionMap: [],\n   actionHistory: [],\n   screenshot: {\n        format: \"png\",\n        dataBase64: ,\n        width: 1,\n        height: 1,\n    }",
      "fontSize": 15.884270156281245,
